+## Checking against a budget
+
+If you have configured category budgets, the `budget` command shows how much you
+have spent in each category alongside the limit you set, so you can see at a glance
+where you are over or under for the month:
+
+```
+python -m tally.cli budget --month 2024-03
+```
+
+The output lists each budgeted category with its actual spending and its configured
+limit, both in US dollars, and marks whether you are within budget or have gone over.
+
